    <item>
      <title>中国驻哈大使连续两日出席公共与司法场合</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-24-cooperation.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-24-cooperation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>中哈合作</category>
      <category>落地观察</category>
      <description><![CDATA[驻哈大使韩春霖两日内出席「丝路杯」围棋公开赛、拜会哈总检察长阿斯洛夫[38][39]；中国—中亚高质量共建「一带一路」与绿色创新发展国际论坛在乌兹别克斯坦举行[37]；贵州省外经贸集团借海外仓拓展「一带一路」市场[25]。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-24-cooperation.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>阿拉木图数字服务指数升至全球第12位</title>
