      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-24-market.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[阿拉木图在联合国城市数字服务排名中列第12位，与伦敦、东京并列；哈国禽肉自给率五年由58%升至78%；总统要求建立铀战略储备，2GW风光储项目提速。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-24-market.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈政府推进7.31亿美元数字基建并调查数据泄露</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-24-policy.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-24-policy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[哈萨克斯坦政府11月24日会议推进约3330亿坚戈数字基建，重点保障数据中心电力与网络接入；同日国安委与数字部调查暗网数据售卖，3家小微金融机构因系统性违规被吊照，工业与建设部长被解职。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-24-policy.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈萨克斯坦承运中中亚间84%货运量</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-23-cooperation.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-23-cooperation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>中哈合作</category>
      <category>金融与物流</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[中中亚贸易2020至2025年从235亿美元增至近700亿美元，哈萨克斯坦承担约84%货运量；成都首发中亚JSQ捷达班列，驻哈大使拜会哈总检察长，双边通道与机制沟通同步推进。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-23-cooperation.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈国轻工业定下2030年本地化两成目标</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-23-market.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-23-market.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[哈萨克斯坦计划到2030年将轻工业本地生产占比提至20%、产量翻倍，配套税收优惠与长期合同；成品油出口禁令延长至2027年5月；Samruk-Kazyna采购被指不透明；数字资产自动交易进入测试。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-23-market.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>成都至哈萨克斯坦JSQ捷达班列首发</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-cooperation.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-cooperation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>中哈合作</category>
      <category>金融与物流</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[成都至哈萨克斯坦JSQ捷达班列首发，为中哈汽车及装备类货物提供新的铁路通道；哈方推出大规模「人民建设」计划并强调经济社会成果，上合组织参与哈高等教育论坛，双边合作层级从中央延伸至地方与人才领域。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-22-cooperation.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈萨克斯坦银行前十个月利润2万亿坚戈，同比减少236亿</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-logistics.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-logistics.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>金融与物流</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <description><![CDATA[2026年前10个月哈萨克斯坦银行业利润2万亿坚戈，同比减少236亿；监管拟更新贷款与存款成本计价规则，并讨论问题债务核销免征个人所得税；同期按揭规模同比增长17.2%。物流侧本期无新增班列或口岸信息。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-22-logistics.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈萨克斯坦农业加工出口增35%，涉农投资工具与信贷税改同步推进</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-central-asia-brief.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-central-asia-brief.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <category>落地观察</category>
      <description><![CDATA[哈萨克斯坦加工农产品出口前九月达34亿美元、同比增35%；总统要求2027年一季度前建成农业统一投资工具。同期，问题贷款核销免个税提案获工作组通过，银行前十月经调整前利润同比降10%。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-22-central-asia-brief.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
